cts. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/27/ripple-s-rlusd-stablecoin-is-coming-to-robinhood-s-28-6-million-customer-platform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Robinhood taps Ripple\u2019s $2.5 billion RLUSD stablecoin despite backing rival USDG</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
